<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia posts $575.4 mln trade surplus in Jan.</title>
<headline>Indonesia posts $575.4 mln trade surplus in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's Minister for Industry and Trade Tungky Ariwibowo said on Thursday the country posted a trade surplus of $575.4 million in January against $916.2 million in December.  </p>
<p>Following are the trade figures for January, in millions of dollars, with comparisons for the previous month and a year earlier:</p>
<p>				January    December   January 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance	  +575.4     +916.2     +416.6</p>
<p>    Exports		 4,243.6    4,683.3    3,601.0</p>
<p>    Imports		 3,668.2    3,767.1    3,184.4</p>
<p>    Oil/gas exports     1,227.3    1,228.8	933.1</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
